{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHANHAI: Myth Origins</strong> is an action roguelike inspired by the <i>Classic of Mountains and Seas (Shan Hai Jing)</i>, blending MOBA-style co-op, horde-slaying loot runs, and deep skill builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/3672cb340f83d1e9f665472cda0d7f03.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to a world filled with mythical beasts. Fight solo or team up with friends, and uncover an epic ancient mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/d937aca7957f6c3e931426f8fd168fb3.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/ea38de7d1c2e5d39858e25f425ae0473.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous land where every battle can send you back to the start. Master the Five Elements\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth\u2014through their strengths and counters. Gather gear, fuse and upgrade it, and forge your own powerful build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/239ed93410064cc11d70b027118fec7e.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/39dd605d9346597e1f61191dd4e809ac.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/bb2173ed10ff56c3b724c8b2f31db4fd.avif?t=1773119094\" width=850 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket mysterious gems into armor to transform your skills. With flexible multi-gem combinations and stacking, every skill can evolve in countless ways. Experiment nonstop and create your own unique, devastating playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/dcb1d926b8e2c82a2e41df8ca5805ccd.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/68f106e6ba52627123c15b339f9c569f.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary weapons from myths become your trusted tools. Use their special traits and raw power to turn danger into victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/dcfdd960f09c607bf08129d6b799d16f.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/354c34389a5b4228769ba71d5c23a155.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beasts of Shan Hai Jing come with wildly different abilities. Choose the right gear, match element orbs and gems wisely, and gain a huge edge in combat. Even greater ancient guardians await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/1a17e5105344d13da773f024289264b2.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/3942dfad97419d5f5c4653a893a6bc38.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go alone for intense, heroic survival\u2014or play with up to 4 players. Choose 4 out of 5 distinct heroes, fight side by side, and enjoy the adrenaline of perfect teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Don\u2019t worry about failure. Collect souls and permanently boost your stats at the Tongtian Altar, unlocking new powers.<br>\u2022 <strong>Telekinesis Weapons:</strong> Store extra weapons in your loadout. They will follow you and attack automatically.<br>\u2022 <strong>Element Countering:</strong> Attacks that counter an enemy\u2019s element deal massive bonus damage.<br>\u2022 <strong>Element Synergy:</strong> Allies with supportive elements nearby gain a large Attack boost.<br>\u2022 <strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Quickly challenge bosses to farm souls, build powerful gear fast, and enjoy pure horde-slaying fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of SHANHAI is waiting for you. Unseal a secret buried for thousands of years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540450?t=1773119094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/a6474fbeef3871cc1bfcc24cf307b121684f4ff1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773119094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/12112e4efb0ef4dd169fda4c548e01f95fd26157/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773119094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/12112e4efb0ef4dd169fda4c548e01f95fd26157/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773119094","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3639350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHANHAI: Myth Origins</strong> is an action roguelike inspired by the <i>Classic of Mountains and Seas (Shan Hai Jing)</i>, blending MOBA-style co-op, horde-slaying loot runs, and deep skill builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/3672cb340f83d1e9f665472cda0d7f03.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6619a39710d57982f446937b159064f3.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to a world filled with mythical beasts. Fight solo or team up with friends, and uncover an epic ancient mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/d937aca7957f6c3e931426f8fd168fb3.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/ea38de7d1c2e5d39858e25f425ae0473.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/5aacbcc0b5a7c5460d2b09abfcec0644.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous land where every battle can send you back to the start. Master the Five Elements\u2014Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, and Earth\u2014through their strengths and counters. Gather gear, fuse and upgrade it, and forge your own powerful build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/239ed93410064cc11d70b027118fec7e.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/39dd605d9346597e1f61191dd4e809ac.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/bb2173ed10ff56c3b724c8b2f31db4fd.avif?t=1773119094\" width=850 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/6e0ff869f8d08bd2c93001159126b550.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket mysterious gems into armor to transform your skills. With flexible multi-gem combinations and stacking, every skill can evolve in countless ways. Experiment nonstop and create your own unique, devastating playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/dcb1d926b8e2c82a2e41df8ca5805ccd.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/68f106e6ba52627123c15b339f9c569f.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/803b1bbf13a494697b9454ea023a5601.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary weapons from myths become your trusted tools. Use their special traits and raw power to turn danger into victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/dcfdd960f09c607bf08129d6b799d16f.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/354c34389a5b4228769ba71d5c23a155.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/829966a6ba54b97e0575b7149d66f5f7.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beasts of Shan Hai Jing come with wildly different abilities. Choose the right gear, match element orbs and gems wisely, and gain a huge edge in combat. Even greater ancient guardians await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/1a17e5105344d13da773f024289264b2.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/3942dfad97419d5f5c4653a893a6bc38.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1560 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.poster.avif?t=1773119094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.webm?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540450/extras/b4ff94221f18a8e021fdf0d384b5a158.mp4?t=1773119094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go alone for intense, heroic survival\u2014or play with up to 4 players. Choose 4 out of 5 distinct heroes, fight side by side, and enjoy the adrenaline of perfect teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Don\u2019t worry about failure. Collect souls and permanently boost your stats at the Tongtian Altar, unlocking new powers.<br>\u2022 <strong>Telekinesis Weapons:</strong> Store extra weapons in your loadout. They will follow you and attack automatically.<br>\u2022 <strong>Element Countering:</strong> Attacks that counter an enemy\u2019s element deal massive bonus damage.<br>\u2022 <strong>Element Synergy:</strong> Allies with supportive elements nearby gain a large Attack boost.<br>\u2022 <strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Quickly challenge bosses to farm souls, build powerful gear fast, and enjoy pure horde-slaying fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of SHANHAI is waiting for you. Unseal a secret buried for thousands of years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Honglizi"],"